    "boundary": "HTTP \u2192 binding/validation/auth/antiforgery/filter \u2192 TaiKhoanService, TaiKhoanController \u2192 EF/SQL Server",
    "baseline": "FR-58; SRS (3).docx.\nThi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF x\u1EED l\u00FD chi ti\u1EBFt (1).docx: UC7.2-U01 TaiKhoanController.DangNhap (b\u1EA3ng 200); UC7.2-U02 TaiKhoanController.DangNhap (b\u1EA3ng 201); UC7.2-U21 TaiKhoanService.DangNhapAsync (b\u1EA3ng 220)\nNh\u00E1nh/kh\u1EDBp n\u1ED1i: Sai m\u1EADt kh\u1EA9u, t\u00E0i kho\u1EA3n kh\u00F3a v\u00E0 \u0111ang ch\u1EDD",
    "strategy": "Bottom-up, BU3; th\u1EE9 t\u1EF1 ch\u1EA1y #162.\nKi\u1EC3m tr\u01B0\u1EDBc: IT-155\nGh\u00E9p sau: HTTP \u2192 binding/validation/auth/antiforgery/filter \u2192 TaiKhoanService, TaiKhoanController \u2192 EF/SQL Server\nC\u0103n c\u1EE9: Sau Service\u2013DB v\u00E0 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp li\u00EAn quan, gh\u00E9p HTTP/MVC \u0111\u1EC3 ki\u1EC3m binding, cookie, antiforgery v\u00E0 chuy\u1EC3n k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 th\u00E0nh response. Kh\u00F4ng t\u00E1i s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u \u0111\u00E3 sinh \u1EDF TC ti\u00EAn quy\u1EBFt; m\u1ED7i TC/DL fixture \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp.",
    "conditions": "Fixture F11 \u002B F0; to\u00E0n b\u1ED9 DL d\u00F9ng fixture ri\u00EAng.\nDL01 password sai; DL02 H1 BiKhoa; DL03 \u0111\u00E3 c\u00F3 ChoDenLuc t\u01B0\u01A1ng lai; DL04 account l\u1EA1.\nHuy=CancellationToken ri\u00EAng khi method c\u00F3 tham s\u1ED1. RV/stamp/Id l\u1EA5y t\u1EEB fixture th\u1EADt, kh\u00F4ng hard-code gi\u00E1 tr\u1ECB gi\u1EA3.",
    "steps": "1. Ch\u1EA1y tr\u01B0\u1EDBc IT-155; t\u1EA1o fixture F11 m\u1EDBi v\u00E0 host test tr\u1ECF DB n\u00E0y; ch\u1EC9 t\u1EAFt hai worker khi ca kh\u00F4ng ki\u1EC3m worker.\n2. D\u00F9ng WebApplicationFactory/host th\u1EADt v\u00E0 HttpClient HTTPS ri\u00EAng,AllowAutoRedirect=false. Actor/cookie theo TC; n\u1EBFu c\u00F3 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp ph\u1EA3i qua Identity/cookie th\u1EADt, kh\u00F4ng fake authentication handler.\n3. GET form t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u1EE9ng c\u00F9ng client l\u1EA5y cookie CSRF v\u00E0 __RequestVerificationToken. Ch\u1EC9 c\u1ED1 \u00FD b\u1ECF token \u1EDF DL CSRF. Input: DL01 password sai; DL02 H1 BiKhoa; DL03 \u0111\u00E3 c\u00F3 ChoDenLuc t\u01B0\u01A1ng lai; DL04 account l\u1EA1.\n4. POST form th\u01B0\u1EDDng m\u1ED7i DL; \u0111\u1ECDc l\u1ED7i chung v\u00E0 SQL phi\u00EAn/counters/audit. \u0110i\u1EC3m v\u00E0o: POST /TaiKhoan/DangNhap. Nghi\u1EC7p v\u1EE5 d\u00F9ng AJAX; auth form gi\u1EEF form th\u01B0\u1EDDng; multipart \u0111\u00FAng t\u00EAn field khi c\u00F3 file.\n5. Ghi raw status,Content-Type,Location/body tr\u01B0\u1EDBc redirect r\u1ED3i assert contract: Kh\u00F4ng cookie \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp th\u00E0nh c\u00F4ng; kh\u00F4ng l\u1ED9 t\u00E0i kho\u1EA3n t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i qua th\u00F4ng b\u00E1o kh\u00E1c nhau; \u0111ang ch\u1EDD kh\u00F4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1ECF qua b\u1EB1ng password \u0111\u00FAng.\n6. \u0110\u1ECDc l\u1EA1i b\u1EB1ng context/connection \u0111\u1ED9c l\u1EADp; Oracle: SELECT Id,Email,NormalizedEmail,TrangThai,ConcurrencyStamp FROM dbo.AspNetUsers WHERE Id=@ACTOR; SELECT * FROM dbo.AspNetUserRoles WHERE UserId=@ACTOR; SELECT * FROM dbo.PhienDangNhap WHERE TaiKhoanId=@ACTOR; SELECT * FROM dbo.TrangThaiThuDangNhap WHERE GiaTriKhoa IN(@EMAIL,@IP); Kh\u00F4ng xu\u1EA5t PasswordHash/cookie/token v\u00E0o b\u00E1o c\u00E1o.\n7. Assert d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u li\u00EAn th\u00F4ng v\u00E0 d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u kh\u00F4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ED5i: Kh\u00F4ng phi\u00EAn th\u00E0nh c\u00F4ng; counters account/IP theo procedure; kh\u00F4ng log \u0111\u1ECBnh danh th\u00F4/password.\n8. Ghi trace/request/test name v\u00E0 TRX,SQL tr\u01B0\u1EDBc\u2013sau,file hash. D\u1EEBng host/worker,\u0111\u1EE3i k\u1EBFt th\u00FAc scope r\u1ED3i reset fixture/sandbox; kh\u00F4ng ch\u00E9p k\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 Pass t\u1EEB b\u1ED9 kh\u00E1c.",
    "expected": "1. Ph\u1EA3n h\u1ED3i / h\u1EE3p \u0111\u1ED3ng: Kh\u00F4ng cookie \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1EADp th\u00E0nh c\u00F4ng; kh\u00F4ng l\u1ED9 t\u00E0i kho\u1EA3n t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i qua th\u00F4ng b\u00E1o kh\u00E1c nhau; \u0111ang ch\u1EDD kh\u00F4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c b\u1ECF qua b\u1EB1ng password \u0111\u00FAng.\n2. D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u v\u00E0 side effect: Kh\u00F4ng phi\u00EAn th\u00E0nh c\u00F4ng; counters account/IP theo procedure; kh\u00F4ng log \u0111\u1ECBnh danh th\u00F4/password."
